#: ../../source/rtk/maintenance/firmware-update.md:1
msgid "固件升级"
msgstr "Firmware Update"

#: ../../source/rtk/maintenance/firmware-update.md:3
msgid "本页目标"
msgstr "Goal of this page"

#: ../../source/rtk/maintenance/firmware-update.md:6
msgid ""
"使用{ref}`NavStarTool <connect-navstartool>`为 **D20 或 D13** 升级固件。尚未安装时可[下载 NavStarTool](https://github.com/myrobotproject/RTK_Interface-Description/blob/main/NavStarTool_260703_cust_En.zip)。升级前先确认目标硬件、使用平台和所需输出协议。"
msgstr ""
"Use {ref}`NavStarTool <connect-navstartool>` to upgrade the firmware for **D20 or D13**. If it is not installed, [download NavStarTool](https://github.com/myrobotproject/RTK_Interface-Description/blob/main/NavStarTool_260703_cust_En.zip). Before upgrading, confirm the target hardware, the platform in use, and the required output protocol."

#: ../../source/rtk/maintenance/firmware-update.md:10
msgid ""
"升级期间保持连接和供电 升级过程中必须保持 **5 V ±0.5 V 供电稳定**，不要拔出串"
"口、移动线缆或关闭上位机。中断写入可能导致设备无法正常启动。"
msgstr ""
"Keep Connection and Power During Upgrade During the upgrade process, **a "
"stable 5 V ±0.5 V power supply** must be maintained. Do not unplug the "
"serial port, move cables, or turn off the host PC. Interrupting the writing "
"may cause the device to fail to start properly."

#: ../../source/rtk/maintenance/firmware-update.md:13
msgid "升级步骤"
msgstr "Upgrade Steps"

#: ../../source/rtk/maintenance/firmware-update.md:15
msgid "点击菜单栏："
msgstr "Click the menu bar:"

#: ../../source/rtk/maintenance/firmware-update.md:21
msgid ""
"在弹出的窗口中选择 `Cus Network Files`，填写升级渠道信息，并设置公开升级渠道 "
"key："
msgstr ""
"In the pop-up window, select `Cus Network Files`, fill in the upgrade "
"channel information, and set the public upgrade channel key:"

#: ../../source/rtk/maintenance/firmware-update.md:27
msgid "选择正确固件后，点击 `Send` 开始写入固件。"
msgstr ""
"After selecting the correct firmware, click `Send` to start writing the "
"firmware."

#: ../../source/rtk/maintenance/firmware-update.md:29
msgid "![Firmware Upgrade](../images/firmware-upgrade.png)"
msgstr "![Firmware Upgrade](../images/firmware-upgrade.png)"

#: ../../source/rtk/maintenance/firmware-update.md:29
msgid "Firmware Upgrade"
msgstr "Firmware Upgrade"

#: ../../source/rtk/maintenance/firmware-update.md:31
msgid "![Firmware Channel](../images/firmware-channel.png)"
msgstr "![Firmware Channel](../images/firmware-channel.png)"

#: ../../source/rtk/maintenance/firmware-update.md:31
msgid "Firmware Channel"
msgstr "Firmware Channel"

#: ../../source/rtk/maintenance/firmware-update.md:33
msgid "注意事项"
msgstr "Important"

#: ../../source/rtk/maintenance/firmware-update.md:35
msgid "升级前确认固件版本适用于当前 D20 或 D13 硬件版本。"
msgstr ""
"Before upgrading, confirm that the firmware version is applicable to the "
"current D20 or D13 hardware version."

#: ../../source/rtk/maintenance/firmware-update.md:36
msgid "升级过程中保持 5 V ±0.5 V 供电稳定。"
msgstr "Maintain a stable 5 V ±0.5 V power supply during the upgrade process."

#: ../../source/rtk/maintenance/firmware-update.md:37
msgid "不要在升级过程中移动线缆、断开串口或关闭上位机。"
msgstr ""
"Do not move cables, disconnect the serial port, or turn off the host PC "
"during the upgrade process."

#: ../../source/rtk/maintenance/firmware-update.md:38
msgid ""
"升级完成后重新连接设备，确认卫星信息和协议输出正常；RTK 产品还应在开阔环境确"
"认能够进入固定解。"
msgstr ""
"After the upgrade is complete, reconnect the device and confirm that the "
"satellite information and protocol output are normal; RTK products should "
"also be tested in an open environment to confirm that they can achieve a "
"fixed solution."

#: ../../source/rtk/maintenance/firmware-update.md:40
msgid "升级完成判据"
msgstr "Firmware update success criteria"

#: ../../source/rtk/maintenance/firmware-update.md:43
msgid ""
"设备能够正常重启，卫星信息和目标协议持续输出；RTK 产品在开阔环境能够重新进入"
"固定解。"
msgstr ""
"The device can restart normally, and satellite information and target "
"protocol continue to be output; the RTK product can regain a fixed solution "
"in open environments."

#: ../../source/rtk/maintenance/firmware-update.md:46
msgid ""
"固件用途和默认输出见[固件与输出协议选择](../operation/firmware-output.md)。"
msgstr ""
"For firmware usage and default output, see [Selecting Firmware and Output "
"Protocol](../operation/firmware-output.md)."
